{
    "description": "Given a staggered grid and one of its cells, report which sides of the whole grid the cell touches. The grid has a span count, an orientation, and a horizontal layout direction (left-to-right or right-to-left). A cell has a span index (its position across the line) and a full-span flag (true when the cell spans the entire line). For a vertical grid only the start and end sides can be touched; for a horizontal grid only the top and bottom sides can be touched. A cell at span index zero touches the leading edge and a cell at the last span index (or any full-span cell) touches the trailing edge; in a vertical grid the right-to-left layout swaps which physical edge counts as start versus end. The touched sides are reported as a comma-separated list in the fixed order top, bottom, start, end (only the applicable ones appear).",
    "cases": [
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 1, "orientation": "vertical", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=START,END\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "vertical", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=START\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "vertical", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 1, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=END\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "vertical", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "rtl"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=END\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "vertical", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "rtl"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 1, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=START\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "vertical", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": true}},
            "expected_output": "sides=START,END\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 1, "orientation": "horizontal", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=TOP,BOTTOM\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "horizontal", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=TOP\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "horizontal", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 1, "full_span": false}},
            "expected_output": "sides=BOTTOM\n"
        },
        {
            "input": {"action": "sides_adjacent_to_cell", "grid": {"span_count": 2, "orientation": "horizontal", "layout_direction": {"horizontal": "ltr"}}, "cell": {"span_index": 0, "full_span": true}},
            "expected_output": "sides=TOP,BOTTOM\n"
        }
    ]
}
